* ============================================================================
* LMR16006X SPICE Model
* direct current source
* change CSS    SS GND 9.8N to CSS    SS GND 1N for faster simulation
* Version : 1.3
* Author  : ee-diary.net
* Date    : 2026-11-26
*
* Change log
*   1.0  2026-11-24  First behavioural rewrite from the functional block diagram
*   1.1  2026-11-25  SHDN pull-up softened so the DC operating point solves in ProSPICE
*   1.2  2026-11-26  Soft-start, error amp, COMP clamp rebuilt MP1584-style
*                    (voltage B source + R + 0V sense + F source)
*   1.3  2026-11-26  Working in Proteus (Vout 4.96 V). Debug overrides removed;
*                    CSS = 9.8N gives the datasheet soft-start (~3.7 ms)
*
* Behavioural rewrite (Proteus / SPICE3f5 friendly)
* Re-modelled block-by-block from the LMR16006X functional block diagram
* (TI SNVSA24). Style and constructs follow the working MP1584 model:
*   B sources using only abs() + - * /, one F source, SW switches, one NMOS.
*   NO u(), uramp(), PWL, .IC, .PARAM, exp(), diodes, or '?:' expressions.
* Pin order = package pin order (SOT-23-6):
*   1 CB, 2 GND, 3 FB, 4 SHDN, 5 VIN, 6 SW
* Modelled: 700 kHz fixed-frequency peak-current-mode buck, 0.765 V reference,
*   internal soft-start (~3.7 ms), internal Type-II compensation, slope comp,
*   leading-edge blanking, cycle-by-cycle current limit (~1.2 A), frequency
*   foldback vs FB (TI table), ECO pulse-skipping at light load, 97 % max duty,
*   bootstrap regulator + CB refresh (weak FET), UVLO 3.6/3.3 V, SHDN 1.25 V
*   with pull-up/hysteresis current, 0.9 ohm high-side switch.
* Not modelled: thermal shutdown, temperature dependence.
* GND pin must be connected to the circuit ground (node 0).
*
* Usage notes:
*  - Soft-start time = 0.765 V * CSS / 2 uA.  CSS = 9.8N gives 3.7 ms (datasheet-like).
*    For quick simulations change CSS to 1N (about 0.4 ms).
*  - Max time step of 20 ns or less is recommended (switching edges are tens of ns).
*  - If the SW node shows a +/- sample-to-sample ringing while the switch is ON,
*    that is trapezoidal-integration ringing, not circuit behaviour: select Gear
*    integration, or lower the max step.
*  - Output is regulated to 0.765 V * (1 + R1/R2) with R1 from VOUT to FB.
* ============================================================================
.SUBCKT LMR16006X CB GND FB SHDN VIN SW

* ---------------- Start-up kick (keeps DC operating point = everything OFF) --
VSTART NSTART GND DC 0 PULSE(0 5 10N 10N 1M 100 200)

* ---------------- UVLO : VIN rising 3.6 V / falling 3.3 V ------------------
S1     UVOK V5 VIN GND SWUV
V5V    V5 GND DC 5
RUVOK  UVOK GND 10K
RIQ    VIN GND 430K

* ---------------- SHDN : 1.25 V threshold, internal pull-up + hysteresis ---
* pull-up current 0.9 uA (+2.9 uA once enabled), fades out smoothly as SHDN reaches VIN
* (gentle 1 V clamp: a steep clamp here stops the DC operating point from solving)
BNEN   NEN GND V=0.5*(abs(100*(V(SHDN,GND)-1.25))-abs(100*(V(SHDN,GND)-1.25)-5)+5)
BIPU   VIN SHDN I=(0.9E-6+2.9E-6*V(NEN,GND)/5)*(0.5*(abs(V(VIN,GND)-V(SHDN,GND))-abs(V(VIN,GND)-V(SHDN,GND)-1)+1))
RSHDN  SHDN GND 3MEG

* ---------------- Master enable = UVLO & SHDN & start-up kick -------------
BENOK  NENOK GND V=V(UVOK,GND)*V(NEN,GND)*V(NSTART,GND)/25

* ---------------- Soft-start (2 uA into ~9.8 nF = 0.2 V/ms) + reference ----
* soft-start charge current 2 uA: 1 V scaled source -> 500k -> 0 V sense -> F source
BISSV  NISS GND V=V(NENOK,GND)/5*0.5*(abs(50*(1-V(SS,GND)))-abs(50*(1-V(SS,GND))-1)+1)
RISS   NISS NISSX 500K
VISS   NISSX GND DC 0
FISS   GND SS VISS 1
* discharge SS (1k) whenever the device is disabled
BNENB  NENB GND V=5-V(NENOK,GND)
S6     SS GND NENB GND SWSSD
CSS    SS GND 1N
RSS    SS GND 1G
BVREF  NREF0 GND V=0.5*(V(SS,GND)+0.765-abs(V(SS,GND)-0.765))
RVR    NREF0 NREF 1K
RNREF  NREF GND 1MEG

* ---------------- Error amplifier : gm = 40 uS, +/-10 uA, 0.765 V ref ------
RFB    FB GND 100MEG
* Transconductance (current-output) error amp: gm = 40 uS, output limit +/-10 uA into COMP.
* Built as a ~1 V scale voltage source -> 100k -> 0 V sense -> F source (= 40 uS * (VREF-FB))
BEA    GND COMP I=0.5*(abs(40E-6*(V(NREF,GND)-V(FB,GND))+10E-6)-abs(40E-6*(V(NREF,GND)-V(FB,GND))-10E-6))
* internal Type-II compensation
RC     COMP NRC 270K
CC     NRC GND 180P
CCP    COMP GND 1P
RO     COMP GND 1G
* COMP clamp 0.5 V ... 1.945 V (10 ohm, voltage-source form)
BCLV   NCL GND V=0.5*(abs(V(COMP,GND)-0.5)-abs(V(COMP,GND)-1.945)+2.445)
RCLM   COMP NCL 10

* ---------------- Main oscillator + frequency shift (foldback vs FB) ------
* ramp current = 700 kHz setting * foldback(FB) * enable
BR0    NR0 GND V=0.5*((V(FB,GND))+abs(V(FB,GND)))
BR1    NR1 GND V=0.5*((V(FB,GND)-0.2)+abs(V(FB,GND)-0.2))
BR2    NR2 GND V=0.5*((V(FB,GND)-0.3)+abs(V(FB,GND)-0.3))
BR3    NR3 GND V=0.5*((V(FB,GND)-0.5)+abs(V(FB,GND)-0.5))
BR4    NR4 GND V=0.5*((V(FB,GND)-0.6)+abs(V(FB,GND)-0.6))
BR5    NR5 GND V=0.5*((V(FB,GND)-0.75)+abs(V(FB,GND)-0.75))
BFA    NFA GND V=0.1269+0.2130*V(NR0,GND)+1.2770*V(NR1,GND)+0.9755*V(NR2,GND)
BFOLD  NFOLD GND V=V(NFA,GND)-1.0225*V(NR3,GND)-1.1490*V(NR4,GND)-0.2940*V(NR5,GND)
BOSC   GND SAW I=65.8E-6*V(NENOK,GND)/5*V(NFOLD,GND)
CSAW   SAW GND 100P
RSAW   SAW GND 1G
S2     SAW GND SAW GND SWRST
S3     CLK V5 SAW GND SWCLK
RCLK   CLK GND 10K

* ---------------- Current sense (switch current) + leading edge blanking --
VSENSE VIN DRN DC 0
F1     GND ISNS VSENSE 1.1627
RISNS  ISNS GND 1
RBLANK ISNS NSNS 500
CBLANK NSNS GND 100P

* ---------------- Slope compensation (sum node) ---------------------------
BSLOPE NSLP GND V=0.4*V(SAW,GND)
BSUM   NSUM GND V=V(NSNS,GND)+V(NSLP,GND)+0.55

* ---------------- PWM comparator : trips when sense+slope > COMP ----------
BPEAK  NPK GND V=0.5*(abs(1E3*(V(NSUM,GND)-V(COMP,GND)))-abs(1E3*(V(NSUM,GND)-V(COMP,GND))-5)+5)

* ---------------- Logic and PWM latch (two cross-coupled NORs) ------------
*   NQ  = NOR(NPK, NQB)   NQB = NOR(NQ, CLK)
BU3    NQR GND V=5*(0.5-0.5*(abs(4*(V(NPK,GND)-2.5)+0.5)-abs(4*(V(NPK,GND)-2.5)-0.5)))*(0.5-0.5*(abs(4*(V(NQB,GND)-2.5)+0.5)-abs(4*(V(NQB,GND)-2.5)-0.5)))
RU3    NQR NQ 1K
CU3    NQ GND 8.7P
BU4    NQBR GND V=5*(0.5-0.5*(abs(4*(V(NQ,GND)-2.5)+0.5)-abs(4*(V(NQ,GND)-2.5)-0.5)))*(0.5-0.5*(abs(4*(V(CLK,GND)-2.5)+0.5)-abs(4*(V(CLK,GND)-2.5)-0.5)))
RU4    NQBR NQB 1K
CU4    NQB GND 8.7P

* ---------------- CB refresh monitor : boot voltage OK above 4.0 V --------
BBV    NBV GND V=V(CB,GND)-V(SW,GND)
S4     BOK V5 NBV GND SWBOOT
RBOK   BOK GND 10K
BLOWB  NLOWB GND V=5-V(BOK,GND)
* Wimp FET : weak pull-down on SW to refresh CB
S5     SW NWIMP NLOWB GND SWWIMP
RWIMP  NWIMP GND 200

* ---------------- HS driver enable = latch & enable & boot ok & not CLK ---
BU11A  NQBUF GND V=5*(0.5+0.5*(abs(4*(V(NQ,GND)-2.5)+0.5)-abs(4*(V(NQ,GND)-2.5)-0.5)))
BU11   NDER GND V=V(NQBUF,GND)*V(NENOK,GND)*V(BOK,GND)/25*(0.5-0.5*(abs(4*(V(CLK,GND)-2.5)+0.5)-abs(4*(V(CLK,GND)-2.5)-0.5)))
RU11   NDER NDRV 1K
CU11   NDRV GND 7P

* ---------------- High-side switch, gate driven from CB-SW ----------------
BGD    NDRS GND V=V(SW,GND)+(V(NDRV,GND)/5)*0.5*((V(CB,GND)-V(SW,GND))+abs(V(CB,GND)-V(SW,GND)))
RG     NDRS NGATE 20
CGS    NGATE SW 100P
RPD    NGATE SW 100K
M1     DRN NGATE SW SW NMOSFET
CSWN   SW GND 15P
RSWL   SW GND 100MEG

* ---------------- Bootstrap regulator : charges CB to SW + 5.8 V ----------
* source = VIN, target = min(5.8 V, VIN-SW-0.5 V) above SW, 60 ohm; only when SW is low
BTGT   NTGT GND V=0.5*(5.3+V(VIN,GND)-V(SW,GND)-abs(6.3-V(VIN,GND)+V(SW,GND)))
BCHG   VIN CB I=0.5*(V(NTGT,GND)+V(SW,GND)-V(CB,GND)+abs(V(NTGT,GND)+V(SW,GND)-V(CB,GND)))/60
RCBL   CB SW 2.5MEG

* ---------------- Models --------------------------------------------------
.MODEL SWSSD  SW(VT=2.5 VH=0.5 RON=1000 ROFF=1G)
.MODEL SWUV   SW(VT=3.45 VH=0.15 RON=1 ROFF=1G)
.MODEL SWRST  SW(VT=0.55 VH=0.45 RON=200 ROFF=1G)
.MODEL SWCLK  SW(VT=0.55 VH=0.45 RON=200 ROFF=1G)
.MODEL SWBOOT SW(VT=3.5 VH=0.5 RON=1 ROFF=1G)
.MODEL SWWIMP SW(VT=2.5 VH=0.5 RON=1 ROFF=1G)
.MODEL NMOSFET NMOS(VTO=2 KP=0.292 RD=0.02)

.ENDS LMR16006X
